 26억짜리 건물을 짓고있는 건물주이기도 합니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d0ccfd3c-def9-49cc-a52e-57cdf6351b5e\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c32e8-d160-11ed-8f1a-b9141d861143\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-imageStrip se-imageStrip2 se-l-default\" id=\"SE-cf9d58e6-67d5-428d-806a-98b62983f0bc\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-imageStrip se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-imageStrip-container se-imageStrip-col-2\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"width:52.89177140175557%;\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-c8e03229-b35c-4edb-a936-ac1181a6fcf9\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMjA2MTJfMjcx/MDAxNjU1MDAxMDM0NDU3.5gAX8P6zQND41qenT7cd9DOM-kVFQoo2MYh9KBVyjS4g.GdorhckQRSZVPWZtMCy5ulidjpDPuAD_hym432Z7CN0g.PNG/%EC%8A%A4%ED%81%AC%EB%A6%B0%EC%83%B7_2022-06-12_%EC%98%A4%EC%A0%84_11.11.38.png?type=w1600\", \"originalWidth\" : \"399\", \"originalHeight\" : \"324\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyMjA2MTJfMjcx/MDAxNjU1MDAxMDM0NDU3.5gAX8P6zQND41qenT7cd9DOM-kVFQoo2MYh9KBVyjS4g.GdorhckQRSZVPWZtMCy5ulidjpDPuAD_hym432Z7CN0g.PNG/%EC%8A%A4%ED%81%AC%EB%A6%B0%EC%83%B7_2022-06-12_%EC%98%A4%EC%A0%84_11.11.38.png?type=w1600\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                    