an style=\"color:#0d0d0d;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c592b-d160-11ed-8f1a-318e448abc5a\">저는 혼자 할 능력이 안됩니다. 그래서 잘 나가는 분들과 동업, 협업을 합니다. 동업하고 있는 회사만 4개이며, 해당 회사에서 들어오는 월 순수익이 2000만원이 넘습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-663be481-d160-11ed-8f1a-5bd4ede91694\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c592e-d160-11ed-8f1a-931757341839\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c7c7d859-2059-4183-ab38-9537c012fe1e\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c5931-d160-11ed-8f1a-51cdb7907c87\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-default\" id=\"SE-c09f3412-0a06-47d5-bbfc-d11d91813978\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-default\">\n                            <blockquote class=\"se-quotation-container\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text se-quote\"><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9e20c0c0-2550-4158-955b-0d166ede0766\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-663c5932-d160-11ed-8f1a-771fb0f40367\">인맥빨로 먹고 살았습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --></div>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-61cd1114-b65c-4fb9-a902-66f7c861173c\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5d7917ea-163a-4b97-bb3d-3ba1ebfd64e9\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c5933-d160-11ed-8f1a-478b40c64699\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-47e59305-e1c1-4a1b-8b04-118f2c86e7f6\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c5934-d160-11ed-8f1a-ebaf99af99e9\">제가 10년간 목동에서 학원을 했었고, 하고 있습니다. 물론 저도 부유하진 않지만 부족하진 않은 환경에서 자랐습니다. 근데 금수저 아이들을 가르쳐 보니, 그 아이들이 부러운건 </span><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;background-color:#fff8b2;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c5935-d160-11ed-8f1a-795de7f1b743\"><b>그아이가 받을 재산이 아니라, 환경</b></span><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c5936-d160-11ed-8f1a-dd01958c9c70\">이었습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-85769fe0-39d7-4efc-bf4e-48f49c6dd78e\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c5937-d160-11ed-8f1a-0d47115ecd50\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-017d378c-5157-4d5e-ac12-16edf4f21323\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c5938-d160-11ed-8f1a-25da509b7c8c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b260354c-96fc-4e43-9de9-8578942b9293\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c5939-d160-11ed-8f1a-9b1f92688cee\">부모가 항상 책을 읽는걸 봤기 때문에, 잔소리 하지 않아도 책을 읽는게 당연하다고 느끼는 집안 분위기</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ba15519f-3734-4ed7-afbf-5fbe3d719b8e\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c593a-d160-11ed-8f1a-bf3e68399004\">부모가 스스로 세상에서 이루면서 느꼈던 경험을 바탕으로 한 세상을 보는 관점 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-612c0070-250e-4b73-ab77-89ab91489681\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c593b-d160-11ed-8f1a-7d039b8f154d\">그리고 그걸 실제 해낼수 있게 하는 &#x27;환경적&#x27; 도움 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-25d8edc9-2f29-469c-9acb-9946720a8052\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c593c-d160-11ed-8f1a-6d9d571973d3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-79160e3e-566c-44d5-99ca-3b790a8a1935\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c593d-d160-11ed-8f1a-172d8c706669\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9688e63f-b2ca-4beb-b8df-ce727a435c8c\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c593e-d160-11ed-8f1a-ed3340bb4a01\">물론 저희 부모님을 탓하는건 절대 아닙니다. 아직 완성되진 않았지만, 저는 이 환경을 &#x27;후천적&#x27;으로 극복했다고 생각합니다. 이 환경이 갖춰지니, </span><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c593f-d160-11ed-8f1a-356137ecc860\"><u><b>수입이 늘더라구요.</b></u></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-98c5b457-21f9-47e7-9e40-0d08b371228e\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c8051-d160-11ed-8f1a-874cff8a279a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5594c46e-0763-4bbf-9098-aa73de55172d\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c8052-d160-11ed-8f1a-1bb388b02388\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6f6b699a-46e6-4cd1-b786-404e17288614\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c8053-d160-11ed-8f1a-eff5c846a350\">저는 여러분께 이 환경(카페)를 통해 실행력을 드리겠습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-66341cb4-5ea4-4003-b85b-f4d0ff79f81a\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c8054-d160-11ed-8f1a-c7f4b8a79e64\">같이하면 할수 있습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-07b46974-c8b8-4e2a-9376-9e3497d8b9e6\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c8055-d160-11ed-8f1a-f1a3b6c43807\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7cbdb98a-ff8f-4fbc-bb26-d69c24332be9\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c8056-d160-11ed-8f1a-8da20bd9aa16\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a4edaf00-1acf-4b16-b91b-97e392fd65f4\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c8057-d160-11ed-8f1a-c925dd688e88\">저도 매일같이 제가 시도하는 모든것들을 같이 나누겠습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-23bafbed-e3cd-480c-aa7d-4e7ab44e89ec\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c805a-d160-11ed-8f1a-e59f20decc25\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-15a0a3f6-2891-4eb0-9c1d-8057652d9685\"><span style=\"color:#0d0d0d;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-663c805c-d160-11ed-8f1a-cb8a949c7fc0\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_bubble\" id=\"SE-bd22873a-ab95-42f9-9885-cf45abd7545e\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_bubble\">\n                            <blockquote class=\"se-quotation-container\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text se-quote\"><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7f6d171e-e0d8-45cb-a823-233d28f1b0e3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-663c805d-d160-11ed-8f1a-192ebd6112f4\">저와 함께 돈 벌러 가실분은 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-218a48f9-8feb-4865-b996-bab32180c071\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-663c805e-d160-11ed-8f1a-237f9e29f85b\">다음편 으로 가시면 됩니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --></div>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-25fc2238-9e75-4462-a3f2-64762ab09f2a\">\n                    <div class=\"se-compo